  "notes": [
    "All geometry is generated procedurally for this project; no paid, ripped or downloaded meshes/textures are used.",
    "Each player GLB contains the full 22-joint skeleton and all five clips, so LOD swaps do not need a separate animation file.",
    "Kit colors are runtime material overrides by material name; vertex colors are neutral shading multipliers.",
    "Hair/skin variation is handled by material color overrides and silhouette variants (male crop, female ponytail, GK headband); no extra geometry copies."
  ]
